<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA EX-FIN MIN SVETOSLAV GAVRIISKI TO HEAD BNB.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA EX-FIN MIN SVETOSLAV GAVRIISKI TO HEAD BNB.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Prime Minister Ivan Kostov said on Thursday that former interim finance minister Svetoslav Gavriiski is most likely to head the Bulgarian National Bank under a currency board system.</p>
</text>
